{
  "uid": "extorq-security-overview",
  "title": "ExtorQ - Security Overview",
  "description": "All monitored assets at a glance: event volume, detections, open findings and service coverage. Counts are distinct ids (uniqExact) so duplicate deliveries never inflate them. Investigate alerts in the ExtorQ console; these panels are for trends.",
